===Noun===
{{ja-noun|r|hira=おんよみ}}

# [[音読み]], [[音読]]: A [[Japanese]] [[reading]] (''yomi'') of a [[kanji]] [[character]] based on the original [[Chinese]] [[pronunciation]].

====Related terms====
* Contrast with [[kun'yomi]] ([[訓読み]], ), the native [[Japanese]] [[reading]] (''yomi'') of a [[kanji]] [[character]] based on the original ancient Japanese word of that meaning.
* Related to kun'yomi, [[nanori]] ([[名乗り]], なのり) is used for readings of names, (given names and sometimes place names).

